// Engine Sim V0.1.14A
// 1939 GMC 228 93 @ 3200
// Created by oror 2026

// GMC
// AC-Series 100, 150 and 250 — 1939–1940
// CC-Series 100, 150 and 250 — 1941–1946
// EC-Series 100, 150, 250 and 280 — 1946–1947
// FC-Series 100, 150, 250 and 280 — 1947–1950
// Series 100, 150, 250 and 280, engine code 22 — 1951–1953

// 1947 GMC Pickup L.A. Noire

